{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "把針附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "傳燈作東邑政語，無蟭螟蟲下一段。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "書𦘕樂附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "香嚴錄亦有類\n此者，不収。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一本小異"}
